<div class='rc-page-shell'>
  <div class='zcs-card zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-16'>
    <div class='zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-space-between zcs-gap-16'>
      <div class='zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-gap-12'>
        <div class='rc-kpi-icon zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-rounded-half zcs-no-shrink'>
          <i class='zc-li-outline ui-1-check-circle-08 zcs-font-20'></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class='zcs-font-18 zcs-font-semibold zcs-lh-heading zcs-color-primary zcs-m-0'>Rule testing guidance</h2>
          <p class='zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary zcs-mt-4 zcs-mb-0'>Use existing claim reports to validate how a sample claim evaluates after policy or rate changes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-gap-8'>
        <a class='zcs-button zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body' href='#Report:All_TE_Claims'>
          <i class='zcs-button-icon zc-li-outline files-2-doc'></i>
          <span class='zcs-button-text'>All Claims</span>
        </a>
        <a class='zcs-button zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body' href='#Report:Pending_Manager_Approval'>
          <i class='zcs-button-icon zc-li-outline ui-2-time'></i>
          <span class='zcs-button-text'>Pending Approval</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='zcs-notes-wrapper'>
      <span class='zcs-notes-title zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-tertiary'>How to recheck a sample claim:</span>
      <ul class='zcs-m-0 zcs-pl-24 zcs-box-border'>
        <li class='zcs-px-8 zcs-py-4 zcs-box-border'>
          <p class='zcs-notes-text zcs-m-0 zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary'>Open a claim report such as All T&E Claims or Pending Manager Approval.</p>
        </li>
        <li class='zcs-px-8 zcs-py-4 zcs-box-border'>
          <p class='zcs-notes-text zcs-m-0 zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary'>Choose a representative claim and use the report action named Recheck Compliance on that row.</p>
        </li>
        <li class='zcs-px-8 zcs-py-4 zcs-box-border'>
          <p class='zcs-notes-text zcs-m-0 zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary'>Review the claim's updated compliance score, warnings, critical violations, and any audit entries before broad policy communication.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>